  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Extraordinary Earth update: November 10th, 2091


    As of today, November
    10th of the year 2091, humanity has made contact with the first advanced extraterrestrial
    civilization.


    We have been visited by a probe with an impressively sophisticated
    design. It is made out of a red artificial metal never seen on our planet, and
    its shape is reminiscent of a crab. For the time being, we have assigned it the
    name  "The Visitor".

    While our scientists try to decipher what information
    it might carry, all planet Earth eagerly awaits the return of the remaining crew
    members of Pinta IV.


    It is without a doubt thanks to your expeditions throughout
    the stars that we have finally been noticed, and it is a pleasure to declare
    the mission of project STARS successful.


    The whole world owes our future
    as an interplanetary species to you.


    Well done, and see you soon.


    STARS'
