  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Monthly Earth update: November 5th, 2091


    Team 7 has returned home
    safely, and we are eagerly awaiting the arrival of teams 8 and 9 by the end of
    the month. That only leaves team 10, which has had the duration of their mission
    extended due to the circumstances you all know. We have been given approval to
    continue even with a single crew member, as the results from this expedition
    are of the utmost importance.

    From everyone here on Earth, we wish you the
    best of luck in the remainder of your journey.


    Now for the news:


    The
    construction of Pinta V is nearly done, and the second wave of astronauts has
    already been selected. We expect to launch the next expedition a year from now.
    We hope you can share your experiences with the new crew members to help them
    on their mission.


    Also, as we mentioned before, while you won''t be taking
    part of Pinta V''s journey, we have a whole year of aptitude tests ahead to select
    the third wave of astronauts. All of you have priority in case you wish to carry
    out another expedition.


    Finally, we have extremely exciting news to share
    with you. You will have to wait a few more days however, as an official statement
    is being made right now. We can''t wait to tell you all about it.


    May the
    stars guide you to our future.


    STARS'
