  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "The solar system was first spotted in 1999, but didn't receive its name
    until 2016, when the telescope TRAPPIST was used to confirm the existence of
    planets orbiting the star. Further examinations showed several planets possibly
    located in its habitable zone, meaning water, and thus life, could exist.\n\nTRAPPIST-1
    was chosen as one of the 10 solar systems to be explored in phase three of project
    STARS, being amongst the most promising candidates for humanity's future. Due
    to its distance, it will be the last place to be visited during the mission.\n\nList
    of confirmed planets:\n\u2022 TRAPPIST-1 b\n\u2022 TRAPPIST-1 c\n\u2022 TRAPPIST-1
    d\n\u2022 TRAPPIST-1 e\n\u2022 TRAPPIST-1 f\n\u2022 TRAPPIST-1 g\n\u2022 TRAPPIST-1
    h\n\u2022 TRAPPIST-1 i\n\nAssigned to TRAPPIST-1: Team 10"
